      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350609393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kurulum taraf\u0131nda en az 1 alan doldurumas\u0131n\u0131n yeterli olmas\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 bu alanda s\u0131kmamak ya da kullan\u0131c\u0131ya atla diyebiliyor olmam\u0131z gerekiyor",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kurulum taraf\u0131nda en az 1 alan doldurumas\u0131n\u0131n yeterli olmas\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 bu alanda s\u0131kmamak ya da kullan\u0131c\u0131ya atla diyebiliyor olmam\u0131z gerekiyor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
